{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/65d0e3c12b09fcbebd8b7ad078b565d4.poster.avif?t=1756819085\" width=628 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/65d0e3c12b09fcbebd8b7ad078b565d4.webm?t=1756819085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay 2 Win is a roguelike idle game about running a game studio. Annie and May, your cute anime-inspired assistants will help you on your quest as you customize your studio, find epic rewards, and find clever ways to go infinite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your repute grows, so do your choices; will you take the difficult path of soulful game design, or the path of least resistance and succumb to the dark powers\u00a0 bequeathed to you by your finance board?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions alter your run and affect your story. One thing is certain - to make it in this industry, you'll need wits, a bit of luck, and resources. Lots and lots of resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/76c622c2426485486f883e92e090cdc7.poster.avif?t=1756819085\" width=1170 height=1164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/76c622c2426485486f883e92e090cdc7.webm?t=1756819085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/76c622c2426485486f883e92e090cdc7.mp4?t=1756819085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Facility System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grid represents your game studio, split into tiles on a 2D plane. Grow your office space by completing missions, find rare facilities to place on your grid, and increase their level and output. Placing certain facilities together activates unique buffs, abilities, and output multipliers that benefit your run, letting you reach greater levels and unlock new progression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergies give certain facilities passive benefits - link compatible facilities together to create output chains that force multiply your output. Rare, legendary items at the end of certain questlines superpower your playthrough and unlock completely  new styles of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/addd20d31543ff48d3b2bf823d51b5ba.poster.avif?t=1756819085\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/addd20d31543ff48d3b2bf823d51b5ba.webp?t=1756819085\" class=\"bb_img\" width=622 height=26 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 unique facilities to pick from! Every playthrough has randomized rewards  ranging from Common all the way to Legendary. Each selectable facility has unique and handcrafted pixel art with a retro vibe, complete with unique animations sure to keep you wondering what's next!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/881692ba73cf589d3e53f00091a5786b.poster.avif?t=1756819085\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/881692ba73cf589d3e53f00091a5786b.webm?t=1756819085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/881692ba73cf589d3e53f00091a5786b.mp4?t=1756819085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/addd20d31543ff48d3b2bf823d51b5ba.poster.avif?t=1756819085\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/addd20d31543ff48d3b2bf823d51b5ba.webp?t=1756819085\" class=\"bb_img\" width=622 height=26 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Playstyles For Players of All Types</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialize your run into one of several unique styles of play, or mix and match to your heart's content! Play a run in a standard idle fashion, gaining buffs and output bonuses based on leaving your game idle, or opt into more active playstyles and select facilities that work with click actions, managing cooldowns, juggling buffs and debuffs, and so much more! The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/59690e45b12b39f0e2050e04229ce5ca.poster.avif?t=1756819085\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/59690e45b12b39f0e2050e04229ce5ca.webm?t=1756819085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/59690e45b12b39f0e2050e04229ce5ca.mp4?t=1756819085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spell and Magic System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast powerful magic spells that increase output, reduce other cooldowns, or grant other, curious effects. The magic system is fully integrated with your facilities, and they interact with one another, granting secret synergy potentials and letting your curiosity shine as your mastery grows. Learn new combinations, specialize your magic to your playstyle, and even start an apocalypse or two!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/dcdd569a3589e09811647c5751795afc.poster.avif?t=1756819085\" width=1170 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/dcdd569a3589e09811647c5751795afc.webm?t=1756819085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/dcdd569a3589e09811647c5751795afc.mp4?t=1756819085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/addd20d31543ff48d3b2bf823d51b5ba.poster.avif?t=1756819085\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/addd20d31543ff48d3b2bf823d51b5ba.webp?t=1756819085\" class=\"bb_img\" width=622 height=26 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A  Fully Voiced Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the new CEO of a failing games studio, and it's your task to take the company from the brink of closure to the top of the charts! How you do this is up to you - at key points in the story, you'll have the option to decide how best to approach problems, resolve scenarios, and alter the course of the story. You're not alone in your quest, however - as your two assistants, Annie, and May, beautifully realized in a cute anime aesthetic, come to your aid. Each of your assistants have their own personalities, preferences, and desires - and it is your job to choose which route to go down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/ec320015e1d4b92f086cac9fe5198cf9.poster.avif?t=1756819085\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/ec320015e1d4b92f086cac9fe5198cf9.webm?t=1756819085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/ec320015e1d4b92f086cac9fe5198cf9.mp4?t=1756819085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/addd20d31543ff48d3b2bf823d51b5ba.poster.avif?t=1756819085\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/addd20d31543ff48d3b2bf823d51b5ba.webp?t=1756819085\" class=\"bb_img\" width=622 height=26 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Sound &amp; Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience handcrafted visuals, animations, and effects as you progress through the game. The UI is vibrant, with your assistants, elements, and even the background itself shifting and changing depending on your in-game actions. Plug in your headphones for an auditory feast as you enjoy  several futuristic tracks, enjoy unique sound effects, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/c1f4cb82059475e568873170c0f2c2fa.poster.avif?t=1756819085\" width=1170 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/c1f4cb82059475e568873170c0f2c2fa.webm?t=1756819085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/c1f4cb82059475e568873170c0f2c2fa.mp4?t=1756819085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Pay 2 Win: The World Is Mine by Scrolling Up And Pressing the Green Button!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/addd20d31543ff48d3b2bf823d51b5ba.poster.avif?t=1756819085\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/extras/addd20d31543ff48d3b2bf823d51b5ba.webp?t=1756819085\" class=\"bb_img\" width=622 height=26 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3390280?t=1756819085","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3390280?t=1756819085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/c160d4d8a2f76432df03ff1b565fb2f9760b07e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756819085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390280/c160d4d8a2f76432df03ff1b565fb2f9760b07e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756819085","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Special Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video clas